{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b764abaae31eaebdfcf553dffb19cb31f25bbf6e3d4532b7f0f118601a83ef4c","ja":"抑えきれない好奇心","zh":"无法抑制的好奇心","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"efe8cd108fec9b627d13beb7f9a487a64dd53e6644f0b6d4109f189272fdf53a","ja":"昨日の収録、人気番組で\nみんな積極的に参加しようとしてたんだけど……。","zh":"昨天的录制是个热门节目，\n大家虽然都很想积极参与……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cedc71cd295d4556d955c491bdf36d984ce0fb768745d7c8a4d3c79ed7794524","ja":"星梨花ちゃんがすっごいやる気で、\n真っ先に手を挙げて、どんどん前に出てたんだよ！","zh":"星梨花特别有干劲，\n最先举起手来，一个劲地往前站呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d04e833bc321fa591b2d19d60d03316a864f34c8ec17de292f0c5073e234731a","ja":"やる気に満ちているのは\n良いことだと思いますよ～。","zh":"干劲满满\n是件好事哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6ec998403e6b5cced4c6dc164d87ff703fd881985c58f6248e6e5199d8ec3963","ja":"そうなんだけど、でも星梨花ちゃんって\nこんなにガツガツしてたっけ？","zh":"话是这么说，但星梨花\n平时有这么激进吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6763851fb632b73083947b350cdfa04aead58ca8a3aafa46e618f625d46def75","ja":"そうね。星梨花ちゃんは元々、\n一生懸命で頑張り屋さんだけど……。","zh":"也是呢。星梨花本来就\n既认真又努力，不过……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4359e8b1d6edfb51c65bd6aa4f5c544eeadc2eeb5c045138a473230938a262f9","ja":"最近は何かあると、一番最初に\n前に出るようになった気がするわね。","zh":"最近一遇到什么事，感觉总是会最先\n挺身而出了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"86d4fc752c22fcf85110d133c189c370a901b0123da6ec572fd3664dc6232a8e","ja":"でしょでしょ？\nだから茜ちゃん、もうチョー気になっちゃって！","zh":"对吧对吧？\n所以小茜超在意的啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6c319e019a4cef9d6faebdabdda691bb7d5451f9860a85070a097d5887e957f7","ja":"星梨花ちゃん、何かあったのかニャ～？","zh":"星梨花，遇到什么事了吗喵～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435","ja":"その日の夜……","zh":"当天晚上……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"04ba09b62d6c59e7688161f33d3984586301e6731558bb5a545c179a943a2ad5","ja":"たっだいま～！\n茜ちゃんのご帰還だよ～……あれっ？","zh":"我～回～来～啦～！\n小茜归来啰～……咦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"30414352f223d3a46b07ad83f122730fc5b5585e32473a709eda48a64be97314","ja":"もしもし、●●●●プロデューサーさんですか？\n今、オファーをいただいてるお仕事なんですけど……。","zh":"喂，请问是●●●●制作人吗？\n关于目前收到的通告邀请……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"2a5ec69d28088c7dd3acc3d17acc14640e19f4b861fe793ebdf7e27c91e45311","ja":"その……できれば全部やりたくって……。\nいえ、スケジュールは大丈夫です！","zh":"那个……如果可以的话，全部我都想做……\n不，日程安排上没问题的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"f83c5d5b01f6e124cb2e4623ba1433f790b9c1fcc15ad4d379c85d24b46b5426","ja":"とにかく、どんなお仕事でもやりますから……\nはい、よろしくお願いします！","zh":"总之，不管是什么工作我都会努力去做的……\n好的，请多指教！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"243d80c689439348188ab304413e94b3204c5e14e996858c67ca2b01140d024d","ja":"やっぱり、星梨花ちゃんのやる気がすごい……。","zh":"星梨花果然干劲十足啊……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1416.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"f546c375d3bbb2501bdb2c92cf656ac0d9e07949b9fe1b0b40cddc70a943d315","ja":"……茜ちゃん、\nもう気になって仕方ないよ～！","zh":"……小茜，\n我已经好奇得不行了啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
